WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:05.293
Cozlin gasped as the enormous dragon tried to squeeze through the portal.

2
00:00:05.294 --> 00:00:10.538
Detective Borzon trembled. "Is that a . . . dragon?"

3
00:00:10.539 --> 00:00:15.869
"Yes!" Cozlin said. "Zark! Close the portal!"

4
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.685
Zark didn't seem to hear her.

5
00:00:17.686 --> 00:00:20.329
He was staring at the dragon and shaking.

6
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.994
"Close the portal!" Detective Borzon yelled.

7
00:00:23.995 --> 00:00:26.550
Zark blinked. "Sorry!"

8
00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:28.927
He looked at the computer controls.

9
00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:35.571
A blast of flame shot from the dragon, burning a hole in the ceiling.

10
00:00:35.572 --> 00:00:38.889
With shaking hands, Zark pressed some buttons.

11
00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:43.113
But the portal grew wide, and the dragon pushed through some more.

12
00:00:43.114 --> 00:00:44.931
Zark pressed more buttons.

13
00:00:44.932 --> 00:00:51.731
"It's no use! The portal won't close with the dragon in it!"

14
00:00:51.732 --> 00:00:56.143
Roar! The dragon pulled itself through.

15
00:00:56.144 --> 00:00:58.316
Its huge body filled the room.

16
00:00:58.317 --> 00:01:00.533
Everyone hid under a desk.

17
00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:04.759
Cozlin felt the room shake as computers fell to the floor and smashed.

18
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.049
Then she felt an intense blast of heat, and the room grew quiet.

19
00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:13.039
Cozlin peeked out. The dragon was gone.

20
00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.401
There was an enormous hole in the building's roof.

21
00:01:16.402 --> 00:01:20.089
She flew up and spotted the dragon soaring over the city.

22
00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:25.604
Delkorians pointed and screamed.

23
00:01:25.605 --> 00:01:27.375
"It's a dragon!"

24
00:01:27.376 --> 00:01:29.627
"Run for your lives!"

25
00:01:29.628 --> 00:01:33.864
A bus zipped around a corner, and the dragon dived toward it.

26
00:01:33.865 --> 00:01:40.545
"Ahh!" The bus driver slammed on the brakes. "Everybody, get off!"

27
00:01:40.546 --> 00:01:44.008
Passengers jumped out of the bus as the dragon breathed fire.

28
00:01:44.009 --> 00:01:47.746
Fwoosh! The bus burst into flames.

29
00:01:47.747 --> 00:01:51.790
A passenger frowned. "Now I'll never get to work!"

30
00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:54.745
The dragon grabbed a car and flew off with it.

31
00:01:54.746 --> 00:01:59.328
The driver leaned out of the window. "Kid Comet! Help!"

32
00:01:59.329 --> 00:02:03.209
"Uh-oh!" Cozlin zoomed toward the dragon.

33
00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:07.949
Zap! A laser shot from her hand.

34
00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:12.024
Roar! The dragon spun around.

35
00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:14.409
The car flew out of its claws.

36
00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.098
The driver screamed. "Ahh!"

37
00:02:17.099 --> 00:02:21.105
Cozlin caught the car and set it down on the street.

38
00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:26.339
"Thanks, Kid Comet!" The driver sped away.

39
00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:32.250
Cozlin flew fast, blasting the dragon with lasers.

40
00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:37.095
"Hmph!" she thought. "The dragon isn't getting hurt at all."

41
00:02:37.096 --> 00:02:41.937
When she fired another one, the dragon looked back at her and growled.

42
00:02:41.938 --> 00:02:45.883
Cozlin smiled. "But it is getting annoyed!"

43
00:02:45.884 --> 00:02:50.258
She fired again. This time the dragon darted to the left.

44
00:02:50.259 --> 00:02:53.695
The laser hit a building's antenna, which broke and fell.

45
00:02:53.696 --> 00:02:57.832
"Oops!" Cozlin flew quickly, hoping to catch the antenna.

46
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:00.030
But then she heard more screams.

47
00:03:00.031 --> 00:03:01.845
Cozlin turned to look.

48
00:03:01.846 --> 00:03:05.718
The dragon was poking its head into an office building!

49
00:03:05.719 --> 00:03:09.569
Smash! The antenna landed on a parked car.

50
00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:13.899
Someone ran out of a store. "My new car!"

51
00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.629
Cozlin felt bad about the smashed car.

52
00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.321
But she had to get the dragon out of that building.

53
00:03:19.322 --> 00:03:24.169
She fired lasers at the dragon's back. Zap! Zap!

54
00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.757
Roar! The dragon pulled its head out.

55
00:03:27.758 --> 00:03:30.533
Then it charged toward Cozlin.

56
00:03:30.542 --> 00:03:33.548
"Yikes!" Cozlin flew away.

57
00:03:33.549 --> 00:03:38.330
She felt flames on her feet and picked up speed.

58
00:03:38.331 --> 00:03:45.533
"Maybe I can lead the dragon away from the city," she thought.

59
00:03:45.534 --> 00:03:50.377
Cozlin flew through a bridge, zigzagging to avoid the flames.

60
00:03:50.378 --> 00:03:52.619
Suddenly she heard a snapping sound.

61
00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.615
She turned around and gasped.

62
00:03:55.616 --> 00:03:58.510
The dragon was caught in the bridge's cables!

63
00:03:58.511 --> 00:04:01.381
Cables snapped as the dragon tried to free itself.

64
00:04:01.382 --> 00:04:06.498
The bridge swayed. And then it began to collapse!

65
00:04:06.499 --> 00:04:09.064
Cars and buses rolled toward the water!

66
00:04:09.065 --> 00:04:14.961
Cozlin gulped. "I need help!"

